  tally 2
  on 2025-06-15
  start 2025-06-15
  end 2025-06-15
  note "RULE-01: house rule A-1 on the 15th, read on the real balance after pay. The run starts on 15 June 2025 with the balance after pay; the pay itself is not modelled."
