source card "Probe card LAW-13 (tmp/cases/probes/law/LAW-13.md): story, rule 1 and question"

unit DUK: currency minor 0.01

index yr = year 2026..2035

input gain[y in yr]: money DUK question "What gain does Ania's forecast realise in this year?"

input rate: num question "What is the gains tax rate?"

def tax[y in yr]: num DUK at start_of(y)
  note "the gains tax on the year's gain at the rate in force in that year; the card states no rounding"
  rule base v card_law = rate * gain[y]

def total: num DUK = sum(tax[y] for y in yr) at reader

ask base_total: total law 2026-10-25

ask before_unchanged: diff(tax[y] for y in yr) in rate25 against law13 law 2026-10-25

ask whatif_2030: tax[2030] with scenario rate25 law 2026-10-25

ask whatif_total: total with scenario rate25 law 2026-10-25

